emailTemplates.body:
Dear {customer},

Please find below the Proforma Invoice for your order:

PI No: {pi_no}
Date: {date}

Product: {product}
Quantity: {qty} units
Unit Price: {price}
Total Amount: {total}

Payment Terms: {payment_terms}
Shipping Method: {shipping}
Estimated Delivery: {delivery} days

Please confirm and arrange payment to proceed.

Best regards,
{your_name}

Dear {customer},

Your order for {product} (Order #{order_no}) is ready for production, but we have not yet received the deposit payment.

To avoid delays, please arrange the {percentage} deposit ({amount}) as soon as possible.

Bank Details:
- Account Name: {account_name}
- Bank: {bank}
- Account No: {account_no}
- SWIFT: {swift}

Please send us the payment slip once done.

Best regards,
{your_name}

Dear {customer},

Thank you for your payment. We have received the {amount} for Order {order_no} ({product}).

We will start processing your order immediately and keep you updated on the progress.

Estimated completion date: {date}
Estimated shipping date: {ship_date}

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.

Best regards,
{your_name}

Dear {customer},

Good news! Your order {order_no} ({product}) has been shipped.

Shipping Details:
- Carrier: {carrier}
- Tracking Number: {tracking}
- Shipping Method: {method}
- Estimated Delivery: {eta}

You can track your shipment at: {tracking_url}

Please let us know when you receive the goods.

Best regards,
{your_name}

Dear {customer},

We want to inform you that there is a slight delay with your order {order_no} ({product}).

Reason: {reason}
New Estimated Shipping Date: {new_date}

We sincerely apologize for the inconvenience. We are doing everything possible to speed up the process.

As a gesture of goodwill, we would like to offer you {compensation}.

Thank you for your patience.

Best regards,
{your_name}

Dear {customer},

We have shipped the replacement for your {product}.

Tracking Number: {tracking}
Carrier: {carrier}
Estimated Delivery: {eta}

No need to return the defective item. We apologize again for the inconvenience caused.

If you have any further questions, please don't hesitate to contact us.

Best regards,
{your_name}

Hi {customer},

We have some exciting new products that I think you will love:

1. {product1} - {desc1}
2. {product2} - {desc2}
3. {product3} - {desc3}

As a valued customer, you get {discount} off on your first order of any of these items.

Would you like me to send you more details or samples?

Best regards,
{your_name}

